{"articleNo":"503828","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=503828&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[수업] 2024년 겨울 계절학기 취업진로상담 교과목 개설","writer":"학생성공과","writeDate":"2024.12.24","hit":"27912","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><br></div><div><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt; text-align: center;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: HY헤드라인M; letter-spacing: 2.3pt; font-size: 24pt;\">2024</span><span style=\"font-family: HY헤드라인M; letter-spacing: 2.3pt; font-size: 24pt;\">학년도 겨울 계절학기 취업진로상담 교과목 시행안내</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: HY헤드라인M; letter-spacing: 2.3pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 20pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\">1. 개요<br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\">-&nbsp;<b>2023학년 1학기 부터 시행(</b><b style=\"text-indent: -37pt;\">취업진로교육, 지도교수상담과 별개)</b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\">&nbsp;-<b><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;졸업요건에 반영되어 미이수시 졸업 불가능</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\">&nbsp;- 졸업 전까지 4회 이수(건축학전공: 5회 이상)</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\">&nbsp;-&nbsp;<span style=\"text-indent: -49.3333px;\">동일 학기에는 교과목 상담을 1회 이상하더라도 &nbsp;1회 인정(1학기 상담 2회 진행&nbsp; → 교과목 상담 1회 이수)</span></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"6674\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"></div><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -49.3333px;\">&nbsp;- 상담 또는 대체이수 중 선택하여 1년에 1회 참여 권장</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -49.3333px;\">&nbsp;-&nbsp;<b>상담</b>: 대학일자리플러스센터 또는&nbsp;학생상담센터에서 1회 이상 상담&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -49.3333px;\">&nbsp;-</span><span style=\"text-indent: -49.3333px;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -49.3333px; background-color: rgb(255, 228, 0);\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><b>대체이수</b>: 학생성공처(대학일자리플러스센터, 취업지원팀, 학생상담센터)에서 진행하는 진로취업 프로그램 수료</span></span><span style=\"text-indent: -49.3333px;\">(</span><u style=\"text-indent: -49.3333px;\">프로그램 안내 시 대체이수 표시)</u><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\">2. 주요내용</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\">&nbsp;가. 적용대상:&nbsp;<span style=\"text-indent: -49.3333px;\"><u><b>2024년 2학기 기준</b></u>&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -37pt;\">전학년&nbsp;</span><b style=\"text-indent: -37pt;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(229, 69, 208); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">재학생</span></b><span style=\"text-indent: -49.3333px;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -37pt;\">(계약학과, IT융합학과, 외국인유학생 및 시간제등록 학생 제외)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 2.1em; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;나. 개설학기: 겨울 계절학기<b><span style=\"background-color: rgb(0, 216, 255);\">(2024.12.24. ~ 2025.2.28.)</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\">&nbsp;다. 수강신청: 별도 수강신청 없음(원스톱서비스에서 수강신청 X)</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\">&nbsp;라. 교과목이수:&nbsp;<b><span style=\"background-color: rgb(102, 232, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(140, 252, 203);\">아래 2개의 방법 중 하나를 선택하여&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(140, 252, 203);\">학년별</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(140, 252, 203); color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(140, 252, 203);\">1회</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(140, 252, 203);\">&nbsp;상담 권장</span></span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\">&nbsp; -&nbsp;<b>대학일자리플러스센터</b>: 학생역량관리시스템(<a href=\"https://biskit.kumoh.ac.kr/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"tx-link\" style=\"color: inherit;\">https://biskit.kumoh.ac.kr</a>) 진로취업상담신청-상담완료(개인/집단상담) 또는</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"text-indent: -49.3333px;\">학생</span><span style=\"text-indent: -49.3333px;\">역량</span><span style=\"text-indent: -49.3333px;\">관리시스템(</span><a href=\"https://biskit.kumoh.ac.kr/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"tx-link\" style=\"color: inherit; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-indent: -49.3333px;\">https://biskit.kumoh.ac.kr</a><span style=\"text-indent: -49.3333px;\">)-하단 바로가기: \"진로취업상담\" 클릭</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt; text-align: center;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmBYHoQdkgVAGgdQHYHkCGBPAlgGwDkAxAcQCkAvAVwFMAPXAR0QDoAHVAcyA%20\" class=\"txc-image\" alt=\"[수업]\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t2024학년도 여름계절학기 취업진로상담 교과목 시행안내(2025년 2월 졸업예정자 필수 확인 !!)\" style=\"margin-right: auto; margin-bottom: 1rem; margin-left: auto; display: block; max-width: 100%; clear: none; float: none;\"></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt; text-align: center;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\">&nbsp; -&nbsp;<b>학생상담센터</b>: 학생상담센터 홈페이지(<a href=\"https://consult.kumoh.ac.kr/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"tx-link\" style=\"color: inherit;\">https://consult.kumoh.ac.kr</a>), 유선, 방문 신청-상담완료<span style=\"text-indent: -49.3333px;\">(&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -49.3333px;\">'심리검사 실시' 제외)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -49.3333px;\">&nbsp;마. 성적처리: S/U&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -49.3333px;\">&nbsp;바.&nbsp;<b>성적확인</b>:&nbsp;</span><b style=\"text-indent: -49.3333px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 228, 0);\">2025. 3. 12. 이후</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -49.3333px;\">&nbsp; -</span><span style=\"text-indent: -49.3333px;\">원스톱서비스-취업진로상담-취업진로상담이수내역(졸업요건/상담횟수 확인)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -49.3333px;\">&nbsp; -<u>이미 졸업요건을 충족한 학생</u>은 상담/대체이수 이수 시 \"U(미이수)\"로 표시&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -49.3333px;\">&nbsp;사. 기타사항</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -49.3333px;\">&nbsp; -겨울방학 기간 <b>진로취업상담실 공사</b>로 인해 <b>취업진로상담</b>은 가급적&nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: rgb(140, 252, 203); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><b><span style=\"background-color: rgb(0, 153, 153); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">비대면상담으로 신청</span></b></span>바랍니다.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\">&nbsp;ㅅ</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 2.1em; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 20.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -37pt;\">3.&nbsp;<span style=\"text-indent: -37pt;\">문의사항: 054)478-7987</span></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
